  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in overt military escalation prompts the US and regional partners to schedule and enlarge coordinated naval and air exercises to signal readiness, reassure partners, and improve interoperability.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d40">us_asia_alliance_stress</data>
