  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A noticeable uptick in military escalation around the Gulf prompts U.S. and allied security agencies to expand export controls, sanctions screening and national-security vetting of AI-relevant technology flows to China, raising regulatory scrutiny intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
