  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A step-up in regulatory scrutiny tied to the US–China rivalry (e.g., export controls, sanctions) restricts transfer of advanced AI chips and integrated systems to regional actors, reducing their ability to conduct or sustain cross-border strike operations.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
