  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter export controls and enforcement related to AI hardware, firmware and software restrict legal and semi-licit transfer channels for high-end autonomy components, directly slowing the rate at which advanced drone capabilities reach Russian forces and intermediaries.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
