  <data key="d37">Tightened national regulatory scrutiny and export controls on AI technologies (e.g., differing U.S. vs partner rules) forces allies to choose between security-aligned restrictions and domestic economic interests, producing divergent national policies and lowering policy alignment within the alliance.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
