  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Cross-border strikes that damage or kill personnel linked to Iranian proxies (e.g., in Lebanon or Syria) provoke immediate Iranian state and IRGC naval force posture increases and explicit use‑of‑force threats in adjacent maritime zones, raising aggregated military escalation levels in the Gulf and nearby seas.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
