  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Strikes across borders that hit Iranian‑aligned groups or logistics nodes increase the likelihood that Iran or its proxies will carry out or authorize attacks on commercial vessels to signal retaliation and impose costs on adversaries and their partners.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_palestine_conflic</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
