  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating cross‑border strikes that imply wider regional involvement prompt reallocation of forward‑deployed US forces to the Middle East and create perceptions of overstretch, thereby reducing the perceived credibility of US‑backed deterrence in Asia.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_palestine_conflic</data>
  <data key="d40">us_asia_alliance_stress</data>
