  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp rises in civilian and combatant casualties intensify domestic and allied pressure on Tehran to demonstrate deterrence, prompting proxy actors or the IRGC to escalate kinetic pressure by targeting shipping routes associated with Israel or its supporters.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-3 months</data>
