  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A sharp rise in fatalities and serious injuries in the Israel–Palestine conflict triggers emergency resupply requests and political pressure on Western donors to prioritize arms, munitions and logistical support for Israel, temporarily reducing available stocks and political bandwidth for new or continued shipments to Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">israel_palestine_conflic</data>
