  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained uptick in discrete security incidents in the Israel–Palestine theater raises near‑term risk premia among energy traders and increases option-implied and realized volatility as markets price a higher chance of wider regional disruption including Gulf supply shocks.</data>
